 "alsoProducedFromM1": "The entry \"follow-up, earlier chats\" was recorded again on 6 Nov 2026, when the earlier-chats feature was removed (design PDF \"Sodhsetu understanding, follow-ups and MCP\", M1): the server now ignores `earlier` unread, so the request is answered exactly as the same message with no `earlier` (since-year.test.ts checks that the two streams are the same, byte for byte). Every other entry is unchanged."
